WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.096 --> 00:00:02.660
(gentle music)

00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:05.000
- There's always room for dessert.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.493
Here's a sweet idea just for you.

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:10.070
- [Nadia] Okay, so I
don't make dessert often

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:11.500
so you wanna trust me when I say this,

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.520
Dulce de Leche Lava Cake was epic.

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:15.250
First, you're gonna crack
an egg and an egg yolk,

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:16.710
add your sugar, and you're gonna beat it

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:18.470
until it looks like that.

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:20.310
You're gonna add your
Dulce de Leche to a bowl

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:21.928
with your butter melted bain-Marie.

00:00:21.928 --> 00:00:22.761
(mixer whirling)

00:00:22.761 --> 00:00:25.900
And add it to the eggs
with your flour, cinnamon.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:27.410
You're gonna grease your
ramekin with butter,

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:29.730
add a little sugar so it doesn't stick.

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:30.563
Bake them up.

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:32.850
Then we're gonna make
our little drizzle cream.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:35.840
Run the knife through it
so it comes out smooth.

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:38.820
Add your ice cream, your
drizzle, and you're done.

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:42.606
- I'm gonna be thinking
about that day long.

00:00:42.606 --> 00:00:45.773
(gentle upbeat music)

